It is now the month of March.
There is a lot of heat in Mumbai.
Now summer is coming.
It is morning.
I am going to the office.
I wear my usual jeans.
Those jeans are thick.
Those jeans are not light.
I feel very hot.
This garment is not good for the summer.
This big garment is very warm.
I take off those jeans.
I wear another garment for the office.
But I do not have light clothes.
In summer, light cotton clothes are needed.
Only cotton clothes are excellent here.
I go to the shop this evening.
